{
 "_comment": "Spine PHI value rules, read by lib/spine/phi-screen.ts AND tools/eta-spine/post_signals.py. formats: one fullmatch regex per id key (ASCII classes only, no flags, syntax common to JS and Python); source_key_format: proxy -> the id key whose format its source_key must have (a proxy absent here is refused). pulse_enc_id is PENDING-PROBE: a placeholder format until .bc/PULSE-ENC-PROBE.md (gating-lead's shape probe) exists; id_key_proxies limits an id key to the listed proxies. Derivation with file:line is in lib/spine/phi-screen.ts.",
